Package: oonetstat
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6
Description: SOCKET AUDITOR
 Inspects open TCP, UDP, and UNIX domain sockets, routing tables, and interface stats.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 oote theme palettes, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
